Lane F done: English and Spanish listening audio rendered with Azure TTS (no ElevenLabs calls). Nobody has listened to the clips.

Voices (already set in each hoeren.json; I only replaced the stale ElevenLabs/"verify" notes with the Azure note and cleared the empty ids). All 10 names confirmed present in the Azure voice list.
 role      English (en-GB)         Spanish (es-ES)
 ansage    SoniaNeural             ElviraNeural
